WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:03.056
The teapot, and the centre of the galaxy.

00:03.756 --> 00:10.126
The archer's brightest stars make a teapot, and the Milky Way rises from its spout like steam.

00:10.576 --> 00:19.590
Look just past the spout and you are looking at the centre of our galaxy, about twenty-seven thousand light-years away, hidden behind dust.

00:20.040 --> 00:24.376
Every star named on this trip is in our own small corner of it.
